edits_description = "Text overlays were removed and some facial expressions were altered."
final_image_tex = SubResource("Resource_oaj7l")
province = 76
blurb = "Depicts people gathering for the Tenth Day Ebisu Festival near the Imamiya Ebisu shrine in Ōsaka, a popular celebration around January 10th to honor Ebisu, the god of commerce and prosperity.

Historically, town markets would be held on the 1st, 10th, and 20th of each month, and since no market was held on January 1st due to New Year celebrations, the market on January 10th was considered particularly important.

This festival is still held today, especially in the Kansai region (around Kyōto and Ōsaka), and remains popular with people involved in commerce."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://6kpsqyb2pk7a"
